<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Foodmaker a buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Foodmaker a buy.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robertson, Stephens and Co said its analyst Andrew Barish has started coverage of Foodmaker Inc with a buy rating based on his belief the company's &quot;strong operating momentum&quot; that &quot;should drive stock price performance.&quot;</p>
<p>-- In a statement, Barish forecast 1997 earnings of $0.85/shr rising to $1.05/shr in 1998.</p>
<p>-- said Foodmaker, an operator/franchisor of Jack In The Box hamburger restaurants, is positioned well in the industry.</p>
<p>-- Foodmaker shares were up 3/8 at 15-1/8 at midday.</p>
</text>
